message: 'To cite package "multigroup.vaccine" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'multigroup.vaccine: Analyze Outbreak Models of Multi-Group Populations with
  Vaccination'
version: 0.1.1
identifiers:
- type: doi
  value: 10.32614/CRAN.package.multigroup.vaccine
abstract: Model infectious disease dynamics in populations with multiple subgroups
  having different vaccination rates, transmission characteristics, and contact patterns.
  Calculate final and intermediate outbreak sizes, form age-structured contact models
  with automatic fetching of U.S. census data, and explore vaccination scenarios with
  an interactive 'shiny' dashboard for a model with two subgroups, as described in
  Nguyen et al. (2024) <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jval.2024.03.039> and Duong et al.
  (2026) <https://doi.org/10.1093/ofid/ofaf695.217>.
